<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila ananassae Turing wavenumber at 2.1 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each pass-2 control is its own function (scale_sweep, ratio_sweep, integrated_ablations, render_versus_plate), and the Lean file states the 2106 nm wavelength and the milli-unit h-condition. Paper equation numbers are not pinned, and the Lean kernel was not run." ;
